    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a complicated relationship with mathematics. While I appreciate its logical structure and problem-solving aspects, it often feels abstract and challenging. My background in physics and biology has made me more comfortable with applied concepts rather than pure math. However, I recognize its importance in both fields.",
